#
#  rezhimy sravnenija:
#    abs  |izmereno - ozhidanie| <= dopusk
#    rel  |izmereno - ozhidanie| <= dopusk * ozhidanie
#    max   izmereno <= ozhidanie * (1 + dopusk)   <- dlja predelov dashita
#    min   izmereno >= ozhidanie * (1 - dopusk)
#  Suffiksy p n u m k ponimajutsja.
# =============================================================================
# izmerenie  rezhim  dopusk  ugol1 ugol2 ugol3 ugol4
A1_VOH       abs     0.03    4.20  3.98  3.84  3.70
A2_VOL       abs     0.03    0.20  0.26  0.33  0.40
A3_TPLH      max     0.15    14n   20n   25n   30n
A3_TPHL      max     0.15    14n   20n   25n   30n
A4_TTLH      max     0.25    6n    12n   15n   18n
A4_TTHL      max     0.25    6n    12n   15n   18n
A5_TPZH      max     0.12    20n   30n   38n   45n
A5_TPHZ      max     0.12    16n   25n   32n   38n
ECHO_CORNER  abs     0.1     1     2     3     4
